  "description_short": "Artisan bakery in Timberlake Village serving freshly baked breads, pastries, and wholesome breakfasts.",
  "description_long": "Tucked into Timberlake Village along the N2, Figtree Bakehouse fills the air with the scent of freshly baked sourdough and buttery croissants. This artisan bakery has become a beloved stop for locals and travellers alike, offering everything from crusty loaves and flaky pastries to hearty breakfast platters and gourmet sandwiches.\n\nThe relaxed, welcoming space invites you to linger over a proper cup of coffee and a warm slice of quiche or a decadent cinnamon roll. Their commitment to quality ingredients and traditional baking methods shines through in every bite. Whether you're stocking up on bread for the weekend or grabbing a quick breakfast before hitting the road, Figtree Bakehouse delivers honest, satisfying food in the heart of Wilderness.",
